# Pairs with StrictAdmitsOnlyServable in SchemaCrossRegion. Reproduces production before #5684's
# fix (option A): strict ingest judged only typed-CRDT deltas and atomic-batch entries, so a plain
# last-writer-wins replicated write whose body the receiver's policy refuses was stored and served.
MODULE: StrictAdmitsOnlyServableLwwUnjudged
TARGET: StrictAdmitsOnlyServable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: strict ingest does not judge a plain replicated write, so a refused body is admitted
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
       ELSE IF Checked(e)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a plain write merges below the write check.
       ELSE IF Checked(e) /\ kind[e] # "Lww"
--- END